  "prefLabel": "Env-Hw 1202.03 Requirement to Obtain Permit",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Hw 1202.03 Requirement to Obtain Permit. Treatment of hazardous waste to achieve compliance with the land disposal restrictions of this chapter shall be subject to the permitting requirements of Env-Hw 300.\n\nSource. #12354, eff 8-14-17; ss by #14285, eff 8-1-25, EXPIRES: 8-1-35",
